# HRS internal source material (SACs, scope & sequences, internal docs)
# Used to anchor brain-break content generation. Contents ignored to keep
# IP off GitHub. Keep README.md, PROGRESS-LOG.md, .gitkeep, the HRS
# subject folders, and each subject's .gitkeep so the high-level
# structure is visible to anyone cloning the repo. Year-level / unit
# subfolders and dropped files are local-only.
source-material/*
!source-material/README.md
!source-material/PROGRESS-LOG.md
!source-material/.gitkeep
!source-material/english/
!source-material/maths/
!source-material/science/
!source-material/humanities/
!source-material/arts/
!source-material/technology/
!source-material/languages/
!source-material/health-and-pe/
!source-material/electives/
source-material/*/*
!source-material/*/.gitkeep
